            "review_text": "Menekag\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam1948 contributions\n1\nFantastic steak and sashimi\nJan 2024 • Solo\nI dined at the restaurant at Vincome Center Dong Khoi. I wanted something fulling after a movie and the restaurant was quite empty. So got a table immediately. \n\nI ordered salmon sashimi as a starter and a steak with some veggies as my main. Both were really good. They do have wine by the glass so I ordered a glass of red wine which surprisingly was excellent. \n\nService should get a special mention. They were very attentive, kind and efficient. Spoke very good English and helped me with my order. When I asked for extra wasabi and sauce they immediately brought some to the table.\n\nI definitely would recommend and go back again soon\nRead more\nWritten January 14, 2024",
