            "review_text": "Adora Dao\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam17 contributions\n0\nBest Gyutan in Saigon - Must Try the GYUTAN!!\nSep 2023 • Family\nBest place for Gyutan in Saigon - beef tongue! \nFirst time trying Gyutan and absolutely mesmerized with the fresh chewy Gyutan and so JUICY it melts in your mouth! what an interesting experience and well impressed. \nI would come here once every 2 weeks and the restaurant is added to top list of favorite restaurant list. \nTRY THE GYUTAN once and you would understand what I mean!\nThe space is pretty high-class for casual dinning! Love the barley ceiling and the bird nest. You can come here for dating, or hanging with friends/ chilling with colleagues - The space suits all occasions. Well done DATE!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten November 20, 2023",
