            "review_text": "Anh Amắn 🇻🇳\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam12939 contributions\n26\nJapanese Sendai Gyutan Steak house in Landmark 81\nOct 2023 • Couples\nWe had dinner at this Sendai Gyutan Steak house while staying at Landmark 81. The selection of meats were impressive and they were custom cooked for us on a traditional portable grill at the next table. Each meat sliced into bite size pieces and served up when ready. We had ordered a set of different meats with Wagyu being the standout favourite. All, however, were tasty with differing flavours & textures.\n\nWe also ordered a couple of side dishes which were surprisingly complimentary - 5 baked oysters and a baked spaghetti marinara. I loved the baked oysters and ate most of them.\n\nThe service was excellent. I hope to come back here.\nRead more\nWritten October 12, 2023",
